		(property "Note" "16-bit SAR, 100 kSPS, 1 MOhm resistive input (no kickback, +/-20 V tolerant), range set by register: 0-5.12 V (78 uV/LSB). AVDD = +5V (4.75-5.25 V [DS]), DVDD = +3V3 so the SPI matches the FPGA in bypass. Reads V_ELEC_ADC (VMID + V_elec/101, 0.57-2.75 V at +/-110 V): 7.9 mV/LSB on the electrode [H]. Second chip select on J3 pin 15. Sourcing checked 2026-11-07 [LCSC API / DigiKey CA web]: LCSC C135986 (997 pcs, $5.48), DigiKey 296-45226-1-ND (1889 pcs, C$11.49)"
