			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a6d8366-f19f-4e78-aa04-438533c89781")
	)
	(text_box "MISC NOTE M1:\nFirmware: after reset write RANGE_SEL_REG = 0b1011 (0-1.25 x VREF) to both; conversions by CS low/high, 32-bit frame, data in the top 16 bits [DS]; never assert both chip selects at once. Read-back check R4: DMM on TP30 / TP39 vs code; TP31 / TP40 = 4.096 V. Sourcing checked 2026-11-07 [LCSC API / DigiKey CA web]: see U41 / U42 field notes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
